
gPokeNewsTextSlateport_Upcoming::
	.string "Greetings! It's time for POKéMON NEWS,\n"
	.string "brought to you by CAPSULE CORP.\p"
	.string "SLATEPORT's most popular kind of guy,\n"
	.string "the ENERGY GURU, is in the news again!\p"
	.string "He promises to, “Stupendously go for it\n"
	.string "in just this many days: {STR_VAR_1}!”\p"
	.string "While he refused to say what he will\n"
	.string "stupendously go for, the ENERGY GURU\l"
	.string "advised, “Save up your ZENI. That'll be\l"
	.string "good…”\p"
	.string "It sounds like a trip to SLATEPORT\n"
	.string "would be well worth your while that day.\p"
	.string "That's the news on POKéMON NEWS.$"

